Package: qrmavfar
Title: Mechanistic Dose-Response Models for Microbial Risk Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sean", "Thimons", email = "thimons.sean@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mark H.", "Weir", role = "ctb"),
    person("Timothy A.", "Bartrand", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Fits exponential and approximate beta-Poisson dose-response
    models to grouped binomial microbial response data. Provides trend tests,
    model diagnostics, bootstrap uncertainty estimates, effective doses, and
    publication-ready dose-response plots.
